# LangSearch

> The World Engine for AGI. LangSearch provides a free Web Search API for AI agents and RAG applications.

## Product facts

- Web Search is available through a REST API, MCP and an agent Skill.
- The Free Plan includes all supported Web Search features. A daily token allowance applies and resets automatically at 00:00 UTC.
- POST https://api.langsearch.com/v1/web-search uses Bearer API key authentication.
- Requests support up to 50 results, date filters and includeDomains / excludeDomains filters.
- Results contain source links and snippets by default. contents.text enables full webpage text instead of snippet, with a default limit of 5000 characters per result.
- For the complete, current request and response contract, use the official documentation below.

